              "instruction": "say the Telugu for to split, then the Telugu for to break off, then say arigipōvu again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Telugu for to split, then the Telugu for to break off, then say *arigipōvu* again]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
